General

Management’s discussion and analysis of financial condition and results of operations is intended to assist in understanding Texas Community Bancshares, Inc.’s (the “Company”) consolidated financial condition at June 30, 2026 and consolidated results of operations for the three and six months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025. It should be read in conjunction with the unaudited consolidated financial statements and the related notes appearing in Part I, Item 1, of this Quarterly Report on Form 10-Q and with the audited consolidated financial statements, and notes, contained in the Annual Report on Form 10-K for the year ended December 31, 2025.

